The Flutter application under `openvalut/`, the bundled KeePass (KDBX)
implementation and parts of the build tooling originate from that project.
Substantial changes in this repository add a Rust server and CLI, a Tauri
desktop client, a browser extension, Android autofill support and Linux
integration.

